{
  "schema_version": 1,
  "locale": "zh-CN",
  "scenario_id": "1_3_30004_01_b",
  "source_raw_hash": "sha256:450a935775bca1508ad4abfe59c5f5547a46a8c9b5cc431c1181f0cf92aa9f12",
  "entries": {
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30004_01:1_3_30004_01_b:cmd-000014:time_caption:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:d97839694a88d3dbaae2835aa42718463b83dd8670118274c73ca9eac5ddd44c",
      "text": "事务所",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30004_01:1_3_30004_01_b:cmd-000020:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:62198205f59aa29a9d4b41819279190b3c5e4b0864713983d7a84d88481388af",
      "text": "哎！？\n我们的歌被选为动画主题曲了？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30004_01:1_3_30004_01_b:cmd-000025:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:46696b6266cc843fca4233ab6278c8c62eca86d298b48a59d126e117007dd546",
      "text": "而且我们还要在那个动画里担任声优……？\n声优工作对我们来说还是头一回呢。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30004_01:1_3_30004_01_b:cmd-000028:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:5a4c8e68445d13041c0ad342a9b1b5ecbb2fb702cfa7347c0d1c86effc4e9103",
      "text": "是的！动画名字叫《明天跳槽去当〇〇！》，\n两位听说过吗？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30004_01:1_3_30004_01_b:cmd-000034:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:98cc190c06f8994eee362c4aa87f6d9ae1ebc60c26968659130d3a5899c9d443",
      "text": "嗯——虽然稍微看过一点，\n但我可能不是太了解……享介呢？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30004_01:1_3_30004_01_b:cmd-000041:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:ee15a4ea464190b28f0f523d656fe06293d441997ff9e2fbf2218a73007db568",
      "text": "我也差不多吧。\n我记得……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30004_01:1_3_30004_01_b:cmd-000045:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:a28ac6a80ac7644641a7f07ab4a9d0860582d6f9656cbd3ee58725b644b14182",
      "text": "应该是主角为了找到自己的天职，\n挑战各种各样职业的故事……吧？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30004_01:1_3_30004_01_b:cmd-000049:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:5fd4ce871128619986d9153c565ecd1163a2d7a14a0b76df8a4a358ae7c557cc",
      "text": "应该是非常高人气的动画系列才对！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30004_01:1_3_30004_01_b:cmd-000054:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:b2eda14ba5df005615498b59122ebb90263114d764ce4b54c1e2b6b853472958",
      "text": "哇，原来是这样啊！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30004_01:1_3_30004_01_b:cmd-000059:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:43a7732a21e2bc79767b18ccd1759b919dfc6c0b29ed83a50d7d3411c4b7997e",
      "text": "……对吧？\n●●●●●●●●●●监督。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30004_01:1_3_30004_01_b:cmd-000065:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:5f9978a82266d686baeed016d07f8afe00a870cc78efbe930a432933571155c3",
      "text": "是的！所以这次……第二期的主题曲\n选定了《LEADING YOUR DREAM》！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30004_01:1_3_30004_01_b:cmd-000070:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:370fd4958f54b81366baf621e5aa56c6082abe8c442a18571a1dcdb325188b1e",
      "text": "自己唱的歌居然能在动画里播放……\n太厉害了，简直像做梦一样啊。",
      "status": "draft"
    }
  }
}
